    "8 min ago": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "8 分钟前"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A Linux server, a cloud host or a Mac mini can each be a machine.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Linux 服务器、云主机或 Mac mini 都可以作为机器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A Mac mini, a Linux server or a cloud host can each be a machine: agents you grant access use Claude Code and Codex on it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一台 Mac mini、Linux 服务器或云主机，都可以成为执行机器：你授权的 agent 在上面调用 Claude Code、Codex 干活。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A binary file": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "二进制文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A grant decides which of your projects, machines and coding agents an agent can use, and for how long.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "授权决定一个 agent 能用你的哪些项目、机器和编码 agent，用多久。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A machine calling itself “%@” wants to join": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一台自称「%@」的机器想加入"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A new server? Enter its claim code…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新的服务器？输入它的认领码…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A project is a directory agents can work in. Then choose in each grant which projects it can use.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "项目是 agent 可以工作的目录。添加以后，再在每个授权里分别勾选它能用哪些。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A project named “%@” is already on this machine, at %@. Choose another name.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台机器上已经有叫「%1$@」的项目，在 %2$@。换个名字吧。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A question expires after 30 minutes if no one answers.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没人回答的话，问题 30 分钟后过期。"
