            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不回答"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Download Hermesh for Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下载 Hermesh for Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each time it’s woken, the bot runs once.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每叫醒一次，bot 就运行一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "End-to-end encrypted: the server only forwards, and can’t read anything.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "端到端加密：服务器只转发，看不到内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter a Pairing Code": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "输入配对码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter a Pairing Code…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "输入配对码…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter a pairing code instead…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "改为输入配对码…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter the Pairing Code…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "输入配对码…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter the pairing code instead…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "改为输入配对码…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Erase Everything": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "全部清空"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Erase Everything…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "全部清空…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Erased": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已清空"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Erases": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会清空"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Erasing": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在清空"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Erasing…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在清空…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every trusted device can approve requests to connect. If one gets lost, remove it from another (swipe left on it).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每台可信设备都能批准连接请求。丢了的设备，在另一台上移除（在它上面左滑）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything that joins needs you": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每次放行都要你本人"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Excludes %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不含 %@ 的用量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Expanded": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已展开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Extra High": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "超高"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Failed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "出错"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Failed sessions": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会话出错"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fast": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "快速"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Find": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查找"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finding…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在查找…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fingerprint": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "指纹"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finished turns": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一轮完成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "First time using Hermesh": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "第一次使用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Folders macOS protects, such as Desktop and Documents, aren’t searched: type those above.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 保护的文件夹（如桌面和文稿）不会被搜索，请在上面手动输入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For a git repository: each session gets its own branch and worktree, and your own files are left alone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "git 仓库：每个会话在自己的分支和 worktree 里，不碰你正在改的文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Found %lld on %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%2$@ 上找到 %1$lld 个"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Get Started": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开始使用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Go Back": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "回去改"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Grants": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "授权"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Group": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分组"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Have the bot make a routine": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "让 bot 建一个定时任务"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Have “%@” make a routine": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "让「%@」建一个 routine"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hermesh": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "Hermesh couldn’t reach the webhook": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hermesh 连不上这个 webhook"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hermesh couldn’t start": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hermesh 没能启动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hermesh erased everything": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hermesh 已全部清空"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hermesh on %@ is %@, older than this app. To update it, run the install command there again:": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ 上的 Hermesh 是 %2$@，比这个 App 旧。在那台机器上再运行一次安装命令即可更新："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hermesh on all your devices goes back to how it was when first installed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你所有设备上的 Hermesh 都回到刚安装时的样子。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hermesh on this iPhone is erased too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 iPhone 上的 Hermesh 也已清空。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hermesh service": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hermesh 服务"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hermesh stops calling its webhook. Its messages still wait for it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hermesh 不再调用它的 webhook。它的消息照样等着它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hermesh wakes it once; it reads any messages already waiting.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hermesh 叫醒它一次，在等的消息它会顺便读掉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hide": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隐藏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hide Archived": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隐藏已归档"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "High": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How agents work": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工作方式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How to install %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如何安装 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Idle": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "空闲"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If no one answers by then, it decides by itself": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没人回答的话，到时它会自行判断"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In %@, add a connector": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 %@ 中添加连接器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Grok’s desktop app, open the routine the bot made: in its Webhook section, clicking “POST to” or “key” copies it. Pasting both into either box works too. The key stays in Hermesh; the bot never sees it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Grok 桌面版里打开 bot 刚建的任务，点 Webhook 里的「POST to」和「key」就会复制。整段一起贴进任意一格也行。密钥只存在 Hermesh 里，bot 看不到。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Place: Change This Folder Directly": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "原地：直接改这个目录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Progress": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "进行中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In its Secure Enclave; it can’t be exported": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "存在安全芯片中，无法导出"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In place": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "原地"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In these projects it can do anything you can.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在这些项目里，它能做你本人能做的事。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In these projects it can do anything you can. You can change or disconnect it at any time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在这些项目里，它能做你本人能做的事。随时可以修改或断开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install Hermesh on Linux": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Linux 上安装 Hermesh"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install Hermesh on it and sign in with the same account.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在它上面安装 Hermesh，用同一个账号登录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install Hermesh on it, choose Use Your Own Server…, and type this connection address:": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在它上面安装 Hermesh，选择“使用自己的服务器…”，然后输入这个连接地址："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install Hermesh on your Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Mac 上安装 Hermesh"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Interrupt": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打断"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Interrupt this turn?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打断这一轮？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Interrupted “%@”": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已打断「%@」"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It Didn’t Wake": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没叫醒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It answered %lld: no such webhook, check the URL": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对方回复 %lld：没有这个 webhook，检查一下地址"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It answered %lld: the key is wrong": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对方回复 %lld：密钥不对"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It answered 400: is the routine paused?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对方回复 400：定时任务暂停了吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It can no longer approve anything at once, and its own machine is removed with it. The machines and agents it approved are reissued by this iPhone and keep working (needs Face ID).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它立刻不能再批准任何事，它自己的执行机器也一并移除。它批准过的机器和 agent 会改由这台 iPhone 重新签发，照常可用（需要面容 ID）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It didn’t join? Remove it": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有加入？移除它"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It didn’t reply.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它没有回复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It disconnects at once and running sessions stop. To join again it has to pair again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台机器会立即断开，正在运行的会话会停止。之后需要重新配对才能加入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It failed (%lld): try again in a while": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对方出错了（%lld）：过一会儿再试"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is still one of your trusted devices. First remove it on another trusted device, under Machines; then sign out here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它现在还是你的可信设备。先在你的另一台可信设备上，到“机器”把它移除，再在这里退出登录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It loses access at once; running sessions are interrupted, and the sessions themselves stay. To use it again, connect it again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它会立即失去访问；正在跑的会话会被打断，会话本身保留。要再用，需要重新连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It may have been approved elsewhere, or it expired.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它可能已经在别处批准，或者过期了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It says it is: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对方自报：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It took it: it works.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "叫醒了：它收到了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It was just woken once, so it shows one more run. From now on, Hermesh wakes it like this when messages arrive.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "刚才叫醒了一次，它那边会多一次运行。以后有新消息，Hermesh 都会这样叫醒它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It will approve machines, personal agents and new devices, just like this iPhone. Approve only if that device is in your hands; if it gets lost, remove it from any other device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它将和这台 iPhone 一样，能批准机器、个人 agent 和新设备。只在那台设备就在你手上时批准；丢了可以在任意另一台设备上移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its name in Grok. Hermesh wakes it for its own messages only; the others’ wake the connection’s doorbell, if it has one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它在 Grok 里的名字。Hermesh 只为它自己的消息叫醒它；其他 bot 的消息仍由这个连接的提醒负责（如果设置了）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its projects and coding agents stay the same. Once you confirm with Face ID, “%@” works with the new expiry and the old grant stops working.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "项目和编码 agent 不变。用面容 ID 确认后，「%@」按新的有效期工作，旧授权立即作废。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its record and conversation are deleted for good.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会话记录和对话会被永久删除，无法恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its record, conversation and worktree are deleted for good. The agent’s changes stay on the branch %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会话记录、对话和工作区会被永久删除，无法恢复。agent 做的改动仍保留在分支 %@ 上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its sessions can’t be shown for now": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
