    },
    "On %@, run %@ in Terminal": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 %1$@ 的终端里运行 %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On a server without a browser, it shows a link: open it on this iPhone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在没有浏览器的服务器上，它会显示一个链接：在这台 iPhone 上打开即可。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On this machine": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台机器上的仓库"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once disconnected, it loses access at once; running sessions are interrupted, and the sessions themselves stay.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "断开后它会立即失去访问；正在跑的会话会被打断，会话本身保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once it reconnects, its sessions and usage come back by themselves; there’s nothing for you to do.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连上以后，会话和用量会自动补上，不用你做什么。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once it runs the commands, its request to connect shows up here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它运行这段话里的命令后，连接请求会出现在这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once you confirm with Face ID, “%@” works with the new settings and the old ones stop working at once.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用面容 ID 确认后，「%@」按新设置工作，旧设置立即作废。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One short turn, in a folder of its own, to show %@ works on %@. It keeps no session.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在单独的文件夹里跑一轮简短的对话，确认 %1$@ 在 %2$@ 上能用。不会留下会话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
