    "Please connect yourself to my computer (Hermesh):\n1. Install: curl -fsSL https://github.com/hermeshai/hermesh/releases/latest/download/install.sh | sh -s -- --cli\n2. Sign in: ~/.local/bin/hermesh auth login %@ --name \"%@\"\n3. Tell me the verification code shown on screen. Once I confirm it on my iPhone, you’re ready.\nThen use hermesh project list to see the projects you can use, hermesh session start --project <project> --prompt \"…\" to start working, and hermesh --help for every command.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请帮我把你接入我的电脑（Hermesh）：\n1. 安装：curl -fsSL https://github.com/hermeshai/hermesh/releases/latest/download/install.sh | sh -s -- --cli\n2. 登录：~/.local/bin/hermesh auth login %1$@ --name \"%2$@\"\n3. 把屏幕上显示的核对码（Verification code）告诉我，我在 iPhone 上确认后你就能用了。\n之后用 hermesh project list 看能用的项目，用 hermesh session start --project <项目> --prompt \"…\" 开始工作，hermesh --help 查看全部命令。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Point the camera at the code in the terminal.": {
      "localizations": {
