    "Send the bot this message in Grok: it makes itself a routine that only Hermesh wakes. It shows the routine in the chat once it’s made: tap it there, or the bot’s name → Details → Routines. Its URL and key show in Grok’s desktop app only.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Grok 里把这段话发给 bot，它会给自己建一个只由 Hermesh 叫醒的定时任务。建好后它会在对话里显示这个任务，点开它；或者点 bot 的名字 → 详情 → 定时任务。地址和密钥只在 Grok 的桌面版里显示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Send this to %@": {
      "localizations": {
