      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "Terminal on this iPhone? Copy a Command for This Account": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "终端就在这台 iPhone 上？拷贝本账户专用的命令"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "测试"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That isn’t a Hermesh code.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这不是 Hermesh 的配对码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That isn’t a connection address. It looks like relay.example.com/o_…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这不是连接地址。它看起来像 relay.example.com/o_…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That isn’t a server address. It looks like relay.example.com": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这不是服务器地址，地址形如 relay.example.com"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Hermesh background service isn’t running on it: run %@ there to check": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它上面的 Hermesh 后台服务没有运行：在那台机器上运行 %@ 看看"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Hermesh core isn’t answering. Quit the app and open it again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hermesh 内核没有响应。请退出 App 后重新打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The agent asked: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "agent 提问：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The changes are on the session’s own branch and worktree; your own files are left alone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "改动在会话自己的分支和 worktree 里，不碰你正在改的文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The changes can’t be fetched right now.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "暂时取不到改动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The code a machine or agent shows in its terminal. Its request then opens here, to approve.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "机器或 agent 在终端里显示的配对码。输入后，它的请求会在这里打开，等你批准。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The directory itself isn’t deleted; agents can no longer start sessions there.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目录本身不会被删除；agent 不能再在这里开新会话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The machine is off, asleep, or offline": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "那台机器关机、睡眠了，或者断网了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The machine is offline; they show once it connects.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "机器离线，连上后显示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The name you know it by, here and on your other devices; other agents see it too. Naming it after a known app (Grok Bot, Claude) shows that app’s icon.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你认它用的名字，这里和你的其他设备都会显示，其他 agent 也会看到。用常见应用的名字（Grok Bot、Claude）会显示那个应用的图标。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The others": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "其他"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pairing code matches this machine’s key": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "配对码与这台机器的密钥相符"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The request expired. Start again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请求已过期，请重新开始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server can’t approve": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器无权放行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The session stays; when %@ sends another message, it continues.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会话还在，%@ 再发消息就会接着做。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Then it can no longer use your machines": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "到期后不能再用你的机器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They prove the approval came from your own device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这一步证明批准来自你自己的设备。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They’ll appear once it reconnects": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连上后会自动补上"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This account is already in use": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个账号已在使用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This can’t be undone. Type %@ to confirm.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "清空后不能撤销。输入 %@ 以确认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This coding agent isn’t on this machine": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台机器上没有这个编码 agent"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This grant is gone": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个授权已经不在了"
          }
