    "This turn is done. When %@ sends another message, it continues in this session.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这一轮做完了。%@ 再发消息时，会在这个会话里接着做。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This turn was interrupted. The session stays; when %@ sends another message, it continues.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这一轮被打断了。会话还在，%@ 再发消息就会接着做。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Those aren’t the digits. Check the other device and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "数字不对。请看看另一台设备，再试一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Those online erase now; reset or pair the others again when you next use them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在线的马上清空；离线的之后各自重置或重新配对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
